{"id":228453,"title":"CLR/50/2023 of ASHOK  KUMAR Vs SURESH KUMAR","court":"Nainital HC","case_no":"CLR/50/2023","cite":null,"report":null,"date":"2023-05-19","judges":null,"disposal":"DISPOSED","nateeja":"Paksh mein","pages":56,"hits":{"Is case ke shabd":[0]},"paras":[{"seq":0,"no":null,"section":"body","text":"SL.\nNo Date\nOffice Notes,\nreports, orders or\nproceedings or\ndirections and\nRegistrar's order\nwith Signatures\nCOURT'S OR JUDGES'S ORDERS\nCLR No.50 of 2023\nHon 'b le Pan k aj Pu r oh it , J.\nMr. Gaurav Singh, learned counsel for\nthe revisionist.\n2. Mr. Vikas Bahuguna, learned counsel\nholding brief of Mr. Nikhil Singhal, learned\ncounsel for the respondent.\n3. An application (I A No.2/ 2023) has\nbeen filed on behalf of the respondent, by\nmeans of which, he sought correction of\nthe order dated 19.05.2023. I n the order,\nin place of \"three weeks\", for depositing the\nentire decretal am ount, inadvertently\n\"three months\" is written, and the same\nneeds to be corrected.\n4. I have seen the record and found that\nthe prayer made on behalf of the\nrespondent is correct.\n5. Correction application is allowed. The\ncorrection as sought for be carried out.\nAccordingly, it is directed that in place of\n'three m onths', 't h r ee w eek s' be read/\nsubstituted in the order dated 19.05.2023.\n6. Office to do the needful.\n ( Pan k aj Pu r oh it , J.)\n 26.05.2023\nAK"},{"seq":1,"no":null,"section":"body","text":"2"},{"seq":2,"no":null,"section":"body","text":"3"},{"seq":3,"no":null,"section":"body","text":"4"},{"seq":4,"no":null,"section":"body","text":"5"},{"seq":5,"no":null,"section":"body","text":"6"},{"seq":6,"no":null,"section":"body","text":"7"},{"seq":7,"no":null,"section":"body","text":"8"},{"seq":8,"no":null,"section":"body","text":"9"},{"seq":9,"no":null,"section":"body","text":"10"},{"seq":10,"no":null,"section":"body","text":"11"},{"seq":11,"no":null,"section":"body","text":"12"},{"seq":12,"no":null,"section":"body","text":"13"},{"seq":